  <h2>Navigating the Global Trade Landscape</h2>
  <p>In 2026, <strong>Global Logistics</strong> is about more than just shipping containers; it's about regulatory intelligence. Fitclo helps you minimize landed costs through strategic documentation and routing.</p>
  
  <h3>Duty-Free Documentation (RCEP & Beyond)</h3>
  <p>For brands in markets like Australia, Southeast Asia, or specific EU regions, we provide accurate Certificates of Origin and compliance data to leverage free trade agreements, often saving our clients 5-15% on import duties.</p>
  
  <h3>Multi-Port Fulfillment Strategy</h3>
  <p>As a <strong>Supply Chain Partner</strong> with facilities in Guangzhou, Dongguan, and Yiwu, we can choose the most efficient port (Nansha, Yantian, or Ningbo) based on your destination and current port congestion levels, reducing transit times by up to 5 days.</p>

  <h3>Integrated Inventory Management</h3>
  <p>Our <strong>Inventory Management</strong> software integrates with major freight forwarders, providing end-to-end visibility from the factory floor to your local 3PL. We handle the complexity so you can focus on marketing and sales.</p>
